  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Once a star stage-diver known for his gravity-defying leaps, 'Scab' lost his flock and a chunk of his beak in a DRIP raid gone wrong. Now, fueled by warmy sludge and raw spite, he searches for the legendary 'Endless Mosh Pit' rumored to be overflowing with DRIP and devoid of Zombucks. Scab seeks to get revenge on the Zombucks for destroying his music venue.",
    "class": "Brawler",
    "name": "Scab the Stage Diver",
    "personality": "Grungy and Impulsive: Scab acts first, thinks later, usually with disastrous (and hilarious) results. Loyal (to a fault): Despite his rough exterior, he'd dive into a pit of Scrappers for his few remaining friends from the music scene.",
